    "['set policy-options policy-statement [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'router bgp 100', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'router bgp 100', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the translation of the Juniper BGP neighbor configuration to Cisco IOS:\\n\\n##\\nrouter bgp 100\\n neighbor 10.20.1.2 remote-as 100\\n neighbor 10.20.1.2 update-source ge-1/0/0\\n address-family ipv4 unicast\\n  neighbor 10.20.1.2 activate\\n exit-address-family\\n##\\n\\nThis Cisco configuration:\\n1. Creates a BGP process with AS 100\\n2. Sets up the neighbor 10.20.1.2 as an iBGP peer (same AS number)\\n3. Specifies the source interface for the BGP session\\n4. Activates IPv4 unicast address family for the neighbor\\n\\nNote: The import policy for connected routes would need separate configuration in Cisco using route-maps or network statements.\", 'trans_template': 'router bgp 100'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'neighbor 10.20.1.2 remote-as 100', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'neighbor 10.20.1.2 remote-as 100', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the translation of the Juniper BGP neighbor configuration to Cisco IOS:\\n\\n##\\nrouter bgp 100\\n neighbor 10.20.1.2 remote-as 100\\n neighbor 10.20.1.2 update-source ge-1/0/0\\n address-family ipv4 unicast\\n  neighbor 10.20.1.2 activate\\n exit-address-family\\n##\\n\\nThis Cisco configuration:\\n1. Creates a BGP process with AS 100\\n2. Sets up the neighbor 10.20.1.2 as an iBGP peer (same AS number)\\n3. Specifies the source interface for the BGP session\\n4. Activates IPv4 unicast address family for the neighbor\\n\\nNote: The import policy for connected routes would need separate configuration in Cisco using route-maps or network statements.\", 'trans_template': 'neighbor 10.20.1.2 remote-as 100'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'neighbor 10.20.1.2 update-source ge-1/0/0', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'neighbor 10.20.1.2 update-source ge-1/0/0', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the tra